{"post_id": null, "posted_at": "2026-08-18T18:57:55.311188", "text_file": "outputs/account4_threads/20260818_185742.txt", "commented": false, "raw_result": {"post": {"recycling": {"enabled": false, "gapFreq": "month", "recycleCount": 0, "contentVariations": [], "contentVariationIndex": 0}, "_id": "6a84ab289c5f0ac338c2bd3b", "userId": "6a843db67c8c976bfff300ea", "title": "", "content": "友達の子供の誕生日に毎年プレゼントを贈り続けて5年。\nでも、うちの子には一度も何もなくて😅\n最初は「子供いないから気を使わせたくないのかな」と思ってたんだけど、先日「うちの子、プレゼントもらうの大好きで！」って普通に言われて、ちょっと固まった。\n「友達だし見返りを求めるのは違う」って頭ではわかってるんだけど、もう5年かあ…と思うと、モヤッとするのは私がケチなのかな😮‍💨\n今年からそっと贈るのをやめようか、それとも続けた方がいいのか、みんなならどうする？💭", "mediaItems": [], "platforms": [{"platform": "threads", "accountId": {"_id": "6a84492577555aae015291d7", "profileId": "6a8448a1e1f937617fe936f7", "platform": "threads", "displayName": "kusetsuyo.qa", "isActive": true, "profilePicture": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.2885-19/468800747_1576664136569291_5396750329151857404_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s206x206_tt6&_nc_cat=107&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=30ff31&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLnd3dy4xMDgwLkMzIn0%3D&_nc_ohc=P3XYQcIJoUQQ7kNvwHrdumo&_nc_oc=AdrIR9J7ucdgxEpn1YMC_jofSZ1aszOrWGyO31rJRzKY-PvU6WX-fW9tYbQ9rHc_C8M&_nc_zt=24&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.cdninstagram.com&edm=AP4hL3IEAAAA&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQLa8HgQxKj5NpeZv0RU0xxhnMZHvUvMAj4UTEyg-hoMnpJ6iPc710w9y_dPPH46_35Um_Auik6s8Q&oh=00_AQHk87hB1WGZy2vnXUXdtoZfLTmE8sFSmg6QQSKrVSMGBQ&oe=6A8A002D", "username": "kusetsuyo.qa"}, "profileId": "6a8448a1e1f937617fe936f7", "customMedia": [], "scheduledFor": "2026-08-18T18:57:44.704Z", "platformSpecificData": {"__platformUserIdSnapshot": "38955193034079301", "__usernameSnapshot": "kusetsuyo.qa", "publishingStarted": "2026-08-18T18:57:45.581Z", "lastPublishStage": "publishing"}, "status": "published", "publishAttempts": 0, "contentHash": "9bae152cbf0c4538c37c7ba8d351e6df", "_id": "6a84ab289c5f0ac338c2bd3c", "platformPostId": "18104218385617621", "platformPostUrl": "https://www.threads.com/@kusetsuyo.qa/post/DcMT0RrEa8U