{"post_id": null, "posted_at": "2026-08-18T19:42:04.340050", "text_file": "outputs/account4_threads/20260818_194149.txt", "commented": false, "raw_result": {"post": {"recycling": {"enabled": false, "gapFreq": "month", "recycleCount": 0, "contentVariations": [], "contentVariationIndex": 0}, "_id": "6a84b5812f0fc98f459f0502", "userId": "6a843db67c8c976bfff300ea", "title": "", "content": "友人の結婚式、欠席したいと伝えたら「非常識」と責められました😅\n遠方で交通費だけで3万円以上かかるし、ご祝儀と合わせると10万円近い出費になってしまって。\n\n「大切な友達のためでしょ」って言われるけど、正直その友人とは最近ほとんど連絡もなくて💭\n呼ばれた理由が人数合わせかなって思ってしまっている自分もいます。\n\n欠席したいなら「非常識」、でも参加すれば家計が本当にキツい。\nどっちを選んでも罪悪感が残りそうで😮‍💨\n\nみんなならこういう時、無理してでも出席する？🤔", "mediaItems": [], "platforms": [{"platform": "threads", "accountId": {"_id": "6a84492577555aae015291d7", "profileId": "6a8448a1e1f937617fe936f7", "platform": "threads", "displayName": "kusetsuyo.qa", "isActive": true, "profilePicture": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.2885-19/468800747_1576664136569291_5396750329151857404_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s206x206_tt6&_nc_cat=107&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=30ff31&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLnd3dy4xMDgwLkMzIn0%3D&_nc_ohc=P3XYQcIJoUQQ7kNvwHrdumo&_nc_oc=AdrIR9J7ucdgxEpn1YMC_jofSZ1aszOrWGyO31rJRzKY-PvU6WX-fW9tYbQ9rHc_C8M&_nc_zt=24&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.cdninstagram.com&edm=AP4hL3IEAAAA&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQLa8HgQxKj5NpeZv0RU0xxhnMZHvUvMAj4UTEyg-hoMnpJ6iPc710w9y_dPPH46_35Um_Auik6s8Q&oh=00_AQHk87hB1WGZy2vnXUXdtoZfLTmE8sFSmg6QQSKrVSMGBQ&oe=6A8A002D", "username": "kusetsuyo.qa"}, "profileId": "6a8448a1e1f937617fe936f7", "customMedia": [], "scheduledFor": "2026-08-18T19:41:53.200Z", "platformSpecificData": {"__platformUserIdSnapshot": "38955193034079301", "__usernameSnapshot": "kusetsuyo.qa", "publishingStarted": "2026-08-18T19:41:53.892Z", "lastPublishStage": "publishing"}, "status": "published", "publishAttempts": 0, "contentHash": "169db8ddb5cacd44f1fece520a3d1639", "_id": "6a84b5812f0fc98f459f0503", "platformPostId": "18099628091198343", "platformPostUrl": "https://www.threads.com/@kusetsuyo.qa/post/Dc